==============================================================================
libdrm (Waydroid fork) - headers used to compile the gralloc override
  app-containers/waydroid-gralloc-fix/files/waydroid-libdrm-6bfcfc7.tar.gz

  https://github.com/WayDroid/android_external_libdrm
  branch lineage-18.1, commit 6bfcfc725fbe0ece0918535556d61ee567b1ffff
==============================================================================

The tarball is a verbatim source snapshot of the Waydroid fork of libdrm.
It is used at build time only: the build needs xf86drm.h and xf86drmMode.h,
which the ChromeOS arc-toolchain-t sysroot does not ship.  Nothing from it
is linked into the installed library - the Waydroid container's own
libdrm.so is what the library talks to at runtime.  No file of the snapshot
is modified.

